:: Himari - Punished [bg-sanctuary]
<h1 class="ptitle">THE SANCTUARY</h1>
<<set $characters.himari.quests.punished_day = $game.day>>
<<set $characters.himari.attention = 20>>
<<set _hmFine = Math.min($player.money, setup.himari.PUNISH_FINE)>>
<<set $player.money -= _hmFine>>
<<addmins 30>>
<br />
You knew before you were through the gate. The yard was too quiet, and the guards at the gate were grinning.
<br /><br />
They had her on the open deck again, on her knees by the mooring post, <<if setup.himari.done('collar')>>chained by the collar<<else>>roped to it by the waist<</if>>, in the rain again. There was a bowl of food on the deck a step out of her reach, filling up with rainwater. Someone had made sure she could see it.
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<image `setup.himari.rainImage()`>>
</center>
<br />
Negan was waiting for you at the bottom of the gangway with his hand out, palm up.
<br /><br />
<<negan>>
	Told you, champ. Every time. Every single time. She pays for the kindness, and you pay for the food she doesn't get.
<</negan>>
<br />
You paid. He counted it in front of you, slowly, and put it in his jacket.
<br /><br />
<<negan>>
	She stays there till morning. You can go see her tomorrow. Bring her a nice word. See what it costs her.
<</negan>>
<br />
<strong>(-<<= _hmFine>> caps. Negan's attention on you reset.)</strong>
<br /><br />
<<link 'Leave'>>
	<<goto 'Sanctuary'>>
<</link>>
